  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficients $a, b, c$ in the quadratic equation $a x^2+b x+c=0$ are from the set $\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}$. If the probability of this equation having one real root bigger than the other is $p$, then 216 p equals :"
